{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/extras/6WcCHRHF9C8.jpg?t=1746265955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Prime World Classic Community welcomes you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prime World is a free online RPG/MOBA game with a unique universe, combining tactical session-based battles, castle management, and heroes. We\u2019ve come together to recreate your favorite game in a refreshed form!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one of two castle designs upon registration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select and create deadly talent combinations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game modes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make friends;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free access to all previously existing hero skins;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hero rankings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve victories on the battlefields of Praia.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An incredible variety of talents and skins allows everyone to create a unique character tailored to their playstyle! As the server evolves, new castle development and combat features await you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684820?t=1746265955","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/7985b4e4a35d02a5479774a0c48195683ea6dac5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746265955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/bbab54e71c2fdac9bce5b69dc5c08f47a0ce87ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746265955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684820/bbab54e71c2fdac9bce5b69dc5c08f47a0ce87ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746265955","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descri